<item>
<title>Mexico's cartel violence: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mexico/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mexico-2026-10-17T11:01:31.660Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 11:01:31 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Cartel gangs are kidnapping local officials to force the release of detained members. The defense minister says cartels are using drones to track border agents and map smuggling routes. The U.S. Treasury has sanctioned four individuals and eleven entities tied to a cartel controlled horse racing network that includes links to New Mexico. Mexico ordered social media firms to remove inciting content within a month and a disinformation campaign linked to a TV mogul is targeting minorities. Three men received 158 year sentences each for murdering Australian and US surfers, and the conflict produced 37 battle related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE1mRFYxTDFEdG5OV1JvTUdxLVBwUTFGd2JzRllMTFlJczZmbnFxbk1HTVFZbWNxOTZXa1NkM3lOZFRJbGRfcWs1VlEtd0ltNVhRcFVTaWprS3dUX0ltcVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxPR01KYUphZnRkb1BYc2NERUdWakRfeFZBenJqV2FnLTk0M2VCbDlMS05JMDUzVXk5dzFjalphYzhOek85U1plMkphWFF0cmF6eFBJQ2Q3S2NrUGhaZ2pCWmtwOEJJUkYyb3hDaG9VM0lpZUN2eWtBMW1VZ2F1ak80M2phYUVuODYyeGZuSjVqdmtZRnNLN2J5aHkyNUlWd0ozc3pOakFfdmhKZDdYcHFva3o1NmJpdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxON1hpbERpNDRuUXJXelZzOFZ1YmEtanN6UDQ4Q2tHbGE2cWd4UGdySVJXWnYwbkw1VVZSVDRFWGUxazBheTRoNGZXYng4VEx6czZpX2doSV9MZF9ydW5UWnpEb3ZHRVZLSnRxNDFPOWlaYkZ0RVZveVhNWF90aXhGdWNJNUxWZFRHeFI1SjVHYkx0eW5McHdReHNtYU1aaUdkLTVkb0tOdHZEYVVv?oc=5&quot;&gt;1News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxON2o0NXRrRmdNQzhVV1RicHNtc2NVVjF3ajJxakhCU0FSTHBPc0VfTWJtTFJJU1JTOVdRSGMtb3l